==Description==
'''Sandcastle''' is an emote that could be obtained at Level 24 of the regular [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It was made by fybirr. The emote is looped, moveable or interactable. No music can be heard while performing the emote, but sounds of the sandcastle being built can be heard.

When used, the player creates a sandcastle which remains on the map for a few seconds before disappearing.

It has a cost of {{BeachBalls|780}} or {{Robux|102}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|8,990}} or {{Robux|1,706}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|128}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,145}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a cost of {{Robux|78}}, with a total cost of {{Robux|1,720}}.

